<section class="dfy-guarantee" aria-labelledby="guarantee-heading">
  <h2 id="guarantee-heading">The guarantee</h2>
  <p class="dfy-promise">If neither result is reached by day 60, you get a full refund of our $1,500 fee (or $1,000 at the founding rate). No arguing.</p>
  <p>Two conditions, in plain words: the receptionist stays live and calls are forwarded as set up for the 60 days, and you share the call log and booking counts for the baseline and measurement windows.</p>
  <p class="note">Vendor subscription fees are paid to the vendor and are covered by the vendor's own terms, not by this refund. Full terms are in our <a href="/refunds/#done-for-you">refund policy</a>.</p>
</section>
